00:02:08.317 --> 00:02:31.625
Cambodian food is delicious. Fish amok is cooked in banana leaves with coconut milk. Lok lak is beef with Kampot pepper sauce. For breakfast, many people eat num pang, a Khmer sandwich. Prahok has a very strong taste! Sticky rice with mango is sweet. Fried crickets are crunchy, and fresh palm juice is the best drink on a hot day.

